     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Expressing purpose and speed",
     "texto": [
      "**为了** introduces the goal of an action: 为了考试，她每天学习 = «for the exam, she studies every day».",
      "**一……就……** means «as soon as…»: 一到家就给我打电话 = «as soon as you get home, call me». Chinese verbs don't need to be conjugated to mark the future."
     ],
